46
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:53,520
back-end engineers just for, like, keeping the infrastructure going,

47
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:55,120
keeping Databricks, you know, plain,

48
00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:59,240
