50
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:09,440
And then we had another team of, like, basically five of, like, data modelers

51
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:13,200
and people who were supposed to start learning to do, like, some BI work.

52
00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:16,080
