115
00:06:28,420 --> 00:06:29,340
I think it's expensive,

116
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:33,360
and I've had experiences with connectors that don't work,

117
00:06:33,460 --> 00:06:36,160
and they, you know, will assist them, they're working,

118
00:06:36,220 --> 00:06:37,760
and then you'll dig in, and they'll like,

119
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:40,580
okay, yeah, we had some data loss there,

