154
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:03,440
maybe I'll make a connector bot here, too,

155
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:05,420
and can you do, you know, some connectors?

156
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:08,480
And they were also way faster than Claude and way cheaper.

157
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:13,840
