202
00:09:56,510 --> 00:10:00,770
I was taking in tasks way faster than I normally would have.

203
00:10:01,230 --> 00:10:06,610
So, you know, normally I'd have a meeting with somebody,

204
00:10:06,710 --> 00:10:07,970
