326
00:15:16,730 --> 00:15:18,190
what's worth it and what's not,

327
00:15:18,690 --> 00:15:20,970
as far as the projects that you're going to take on

328
00:15:20,970 --> 00:15:22,170
and the compute that you're going to use.

329
00:15:22,670 --> 00:15:24,150
So, really love Databricks.

330
00:15:24,430 --> 00:15:25,790
The other one, of course, is Grok Bot.

331
00:15:26,110 --> 00:15:28,690
I will bet on Grok Bot pretty much every time right now.

